2 CONT Leopoldo Torlonia (25 July 1853—23 October 1918) was an Italian nobleman and politician, who was Mayor of Rome from May 1882 to May 1887.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the third duke of Poli and of Guadagnolo.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was dismissed from office in 1887 by then Prime Minister Francesco Crispi for congratulating Pope Leo XIII on his Jubilee.
