2 CONT M, #96581, b. 30 August 1876, d. 10 January 1964
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=10 May 2003
2 CONT
2 CONT      Franz Emanuel Konstantin Prinz zu Salm-Salm was born on 30 August 1876 at Anhalt. He was the son of Alfred XII Fürst zu Salm-Salm and Rosa Gräfin von Lutzow. He married Maria Anna Baronin von und zu Dalberg, daughter of Karl 
2 CONC Baron von und zu Dalberg and Gabriele Gräfin von Spiegel zum Diesenberg-Hanzleden, on 16 November 1912 at Prague, Czech Republic. He died on 10 January 1964 at age 87 at Loburg bei Coesfeld, Germany.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Franz Emanuel Konstantin Prinz zu Salm-Salm gained the title of Prinz zu Salm-Salm.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Franz Emanuel Konstantin Prinz zu Salm-Salm and Maria Anna Baronin von und zu Dalberg
2 CONT
