2 CONT https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rospigliosi_family
2 CONT
2 CONT The House of Rospigliosi is an ancient noble Italian family from Pistoia. Attested since the Middle Ages, it became wealthy through agriculture, trade and industry, reaching the apogee of its power and the high nobility status in 
2 CONC Rome thanks to Giulio Rospigliosi, elected pope in 1667 with the name of Clement IX.
