1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://genealogics.org/getperson.php?personID=I00211808&tree=LEO
2 CONT
2 CONT Leone Massimo, Prince di Arsoli M, #86971, b. 1896, d. 1979 Last Edited=22 Nov 2008
2 CONT      Leone Massimo, Prince di Arsoli was born in 1896 at Rome, Italy. He was the son of Camillo Francesco Massimo, Prince di Arsoli and Eleonora Brancaccio. He married Adelaide di Savoia-Genova, Principessa di Savoia, daughter of 
2 CONC Tommaso di Savoia-Genova, 2nd Duca di Genova and Isabella Marie Elisabeth Prinzessin von Bayern, on 15 July 1935.1 He died in 1979 at Rome, Italy.
2 CONT      Leone Massimo, Prince di Arsoli gained the title of Prince di Arsoli. Children of Leone Massimo, Prince di Arsoli and Adelaide di Savoia-Genova, Principessa di Savoia -1. Isabella Massimo+ b. 5 Jun 1936 -2. Filippo Massimo, P
2 CONC rince di Arsoli+ b. 29 Sep 1938 -3. Ferdinando Massimo+ b. 20 Jan 1940 -4. Carlo Massimo b. 3 Jul 1942 -5. Maria Eleonora Massimo+ b. 30 Mar 1944 -6. Francesco Massimo b. 15 Jul 1946
2 CONT
2 CONT Source / Forrás: http://thepeerage.com/p8698.htm#i86971
