2 CONT '''Conte Adinolfo Lucchesi-Palli''' was born on 18 June 1911. He is the son of Pietro Lucchesi-Palli, Conte Lucchesi-Palli and Beatrice Colomba Maria di Borbone, Principessa di Parma. He married Sarolta Teleki Gräfin von Szek on 2
2 CONC  June 1946. Children of Conte Adinolfo Lucchesi-Palli and Sarolta Teleki Gräfin von Szek
