0 @N6000000002322315665@ NOTE Sophie was a lady-in-waiting Countess, and considered a low rank to marry a
1 CONT potential King or Emperor, so, desire of Francis Ferdinand to marry her met
1 CONT with his forced renouncement of his future children's rights to the throne.
1 CONT Afterwards, the morganatic marriage took place in 1900. In June 1914,
1 CONT however, she and her husband were assassinated by the Serb nationalist
1 CONT Gavrilo Princip at Sarajevo. A month later, World War I began with Austria's
1 CONT declaration of war against the Serbs.
